  </div>  <div class="section" id="tips">
    <h2>Lifestyle Tips</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Morning routines that actually work</li>
      <li>Simple nutrition hacks</li>
      <li>Tech tools to upgrade your life</li>
    </ul>
  </div>  <div class="section" id="blog">
    <h2>Latest Blog Posts</h2>
    <div class="blog-post">
      <h3>5 Ways to Boost Productivity</h3>
      <p>Discover simple yet effective techniques to stay focused and get more done in less time.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="blog-post">
      <h3>How to Eat Healthy on a Budget</h3>
      <p>Learn how to plan meals, shop smart, and enjoy nutritious food without overspending.</p>
    </div>
  </div>  <div class="section" id="newsletter">
    <h2>Subscribe to Our Newsletter</h2>
